{"id":"eb639084525fd226","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence.md","title":"全体可及与关系良基等价","display":"thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence — 全体可及与关系良基等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence","aliases":["72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence"],"display":"thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence — 全体可及与关系良基等价","depends_on":["[[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.2, print270–271/PDF282–283; local corollary with empty-case check","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence — 全体可及与关系良基等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce118b25d2b12cdc\" href=\"?note=ce118b25d2b12cdc\" title=\"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded\">72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.2, print270–271/PDF282–283; local corollary with empty-case check"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(O,\\prec)\">\\((O,\\prec)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\">\\(\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce118b25d2b12cdc\" href=\"?note=ce118b25d2b12cdc\" title=\"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded\">72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded</a>；不预先假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 非空、线性有序或为序数记号系统。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec=O\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{WF}(O,\\prec).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec=O\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{WF}(O,\\prec).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向右将上一结果的可及部分限制关系取为整个关系。向左取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=O\">\\(B=O\\)</span>；它自动向下闭，良基归纳得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\subseteq\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\">\\(O\\subseteq\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec\\)</span>，反包含由定义。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=\\varnothing\">\\(O=\\varnothing\\)</span>，两边都成立。由此可以把ε0记号的外部良序证明转成全体代码可及；不能从代码有限可生成这一语法事实直接得到良基性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$、$\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 与 $\\mathrm{WF}$ 同 [[72-thm-accessible-part-well-founded]]；不预先假设 $O$ 非空、线性有序或为序数记号系统。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(O,\\prec)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec=O\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{WF}(O,\\prec).","display":true},{"tex":"B=O","display":false},{"tex":"O\\subseteq\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"O=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1497,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-451","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence|thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence — 全体可及与关系良基等价]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-449","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可及良基等价：[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence|thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence — 全体可及与关系良基等价]]"},{"id":"6b40e3ecfaa895b6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元理论前驱良基性；[[72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]] 给出同一关系与最小可及闭包的等价。这里的WF不是二阶算术中的对象公式WO。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-417","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-accessibility-well-founded-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["ce118b25d2b12cdc"]}